SWITCH CHARACTERS! I never advanced gradually in nethack, it was
always by leaps and bounds, but the thing that always helped me break
through the wall was switching characters. It's too easy to get stuck
in a rut, say you're playing a wizard who started with a spellbook of
charm monster or a valk who got a wish for GDSM who did really well,
you'll spend all your time trying to duplicate the situation where you
did well and end up screwing up. Then you try say, an archeologist and
try completely new strategies. This applies to any point in the game,
if you just can't advance, try new characters.

